      "content_head": "```swift\n/// Returns the n-th Fibonacci number (0-indexed), where `fibonacci(0) == 0` and `fibonacci(1) == 1`.\n///\n/// - Parameter n: The index in the Fibonacci sequence. Must be non-negative.\n/// - Returns: The Fibonacci number at the given index.\n/// - Precondition: `n` must be greater than or equ",
